          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Punching Back Against Parkinson’s",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_BKke99": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Punch Out Parkinson’s supports people living with Parkinson’s disease through non contact boxing, movement, and community. Our program uses exercise to help manage symptoms, improve balance, strength, coordination, and support overall quality of life in a safe and motivating environment. Designed for all fitness levels and stages of diagnosis, classes are adaptable and welcoming. Beyond physical benefits, Punch Out Parkinson’s builds confidence, connection, and resilience, helping participants move forward together with strength and purpose.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
        "button_dncxRq": {
