        "text_tky6gV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Box2Fit is more than a boxing gym. It’s a family-driven boxing community built on passion, hard work, and growth. What started over ten years ago as a father and daughter training together in a park has grown into three thriving boxing clubs rooted in a love for the sport. Today, our team of dedicated coaches combines world-class training with that same family-first foundation, helping men, women, and children build strength, confidence, and skill in a supportive, high-energy environment.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        },
